  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA distributed value fell 7.9% over 30D:</strong> On-chain RWA distributed value at $14.69B (7.9% lower over 30D) hints that tokenized asset growth paused or reversed\u2014more consistent with risk-off allocation or redemptions than a pure news cycle. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxOS1M3dFdnaHdFNGh3VzJJOXd4TTd1WThPdzNvVGl4WVZpVDVEOFNody0talNRN0pMZ1pMMURTOFdSZ0lwSXRHckdOSTlBclJvS0twMFFXLU5xdWlhTGxfMlpVd2hEQXZJTkhLdFRod3gyejJHTWRiVnFmblg1bTZPWXZXVjl0V1FnQ3hOZDZ1c0h0LWJuRkdmQkV6TmdJWV9Pa3RzU2tTbGdpT3BWbTdpSlNsRHhhOHJNalY4M2tDaEwwNEV1cTF1cHFR?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">U.S. SEC maps out crypto custody in new proposal that furthers its digital assets agenda</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Tokenized U.S. Treasuries remain the institutional bridge into RWAs:</strong> adoption is strongest where products plug into cash management, collateral, and liquidity workflows. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/converge/tradfi-and-fintech/dune-flags-yield-shortfall-at-tokenized-money-funds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dune Flags Yield Shortfall at Tokenized Money Funds</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Institutional commitments are still a leading share signal:</strong> Bank and asset-manager distribution deals often shift platform and network leadership before headline RWA totals fully catch up. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/10/01/u-s-sec-maps-out-crypto-custody-in-new-proposal-that-furthers-its-digital-assets-agenda\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SEC proposes new crypto custody rules for investment advisers and funds</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Clearer rules tend to unlock balance-sheet participation and collateral workflows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/markets/2026-09-30-clarity-acts-failure-gave-crypto-faster-regulatory-wins-bitwise-says-417362\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Clarity Act\u2019s failure gave crypto \u2018faster\u2019 regulatory wins, Bitwise CIO says</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
